        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Fixtures (synthetic only):&lt;/b&gt; CUS-1001 Amina Khan (ACTIVE) · CUS-1002 Ravi Singh (PROSPECT) · CUS-9999 (not found)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Security:&lt;/b&gt; no token → 401 · wrong role → 403 · the API enforces roles, not Angular&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Images:&lt;/b&gt; backend/Dockerfile → crm-api · frontend/Dockerfile → crm-ui" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
